        "name": "Strong Room",
        "html": "<p>A reinforced chamber behind a heavy combination door, deed boxes and jewelry cases lining built-in shelves.</p><ul class=\"room-bullets\"><li>Several sealed packets are each assigned to a specific member of the household by name.</li><li>A small tin of emergency cash sits untouched near the door.</li></ul>",
        "plot": false,
        "plotType": null,
